#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:5
msgid "How to Use a Laptop/Tablet Securely – HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何安全使用平板電腦 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:11
msgid "How to use a laptop/tablet securely"
msgstr "如何安全使用平板電腦"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:12
msgid "How to make sure your online banking experience is safe and secure"
msgstr "以安全穩妥的方式使用網上理財服務"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:14
msgid "Cyber security &amp; fraud hub"
msgstr "網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:20
msgid ""
"Online banking is fast and convenient, but it’s important to make sure "
"you aren’t exposing yourself to fraud or financial crime. Follow these "
"tips to keep your accounts and private data secure."
msgstr "網上理財服務快捷方便，但亦務必採取措施來防範欺詐和金融罪案。建議遵照以下守則，以保戶口和個人資料萬全。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:24
msgid "What you can do to keep your internet banking safe"
msgstr "網上理財服務安全使用守則"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:25
msgid "Accessing your account"
msgstr "登入您的戶口"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:27
msgid "Avoid using public computers for online banking."
msgstr "避免使用公用電腦登入網上理財"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:28
msgid ""
"Never share your personal security details (PIN or security code) with "
"anyone."
msgstr "切忌與他人分享您的個人保安資料（密碼或保安編碼）"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:29
msgid ""
"If you notice unusual pop-ups or your computer is unusually slow, do not "
"enter personal details—report it to HSBC immediately."
msgstr "如果您發現任何不尋常的彈出式視窗或電腦反應異常緩慢，請勿提供您的個人資料及／或信用卡資料，並立即致電客戶服務熱線通知我們"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:30
msgid ""
"Be wary of “business opportunities” involving receiving or holding money "
"for strangers (money-laundering scams)."
msgstr "當心清洗黑錢的騙局。提防涉及替陌生人接收或保存金錢的「商機」"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:31
msgid ""
"Only use secure and trusted wireless networks. Password-protect your home"
" Wi-Fi."
msgstr "只使用安全而可信賴的無線網絡，自己的家居Wi-Fi無線網絡亦應加設密碼"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:34
msgid "If you receive any email or SMS claiming to be from HSBC, remember:"
msgstr "若您收到自稱由滙豐發出的任何電郵或短訊，請謹記下列各項："

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:36
msgid ""
"HSBC will never ask you to confirm or provide personal data by replying "
"to an email."
msgstr "在任何情況下，我們都不會要求您回覆電郵以確認或提供任何個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:37
msgid ""
"We will not ask for excessive information (e.g. HKID, passport, credit "
"card details, CVV/CVC code, expiry date)."
msgstr "我們不會要求您提供過多敏感資料，例如姓名、香港身份證／護照號碼、信用卡號碼、CVV／CVC碼和到期日"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:38
msgid ""
"HSBC emails/texts never include hyperlinks to the logon page or any page "
"requesting personal info."
msgstr "我們的電郵和文字訊息絕不會包含前往滙豐個人網上理財登入頁面（或要求您填寫個人資料的任何頁面）的超連結"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:41
msgid "Monitoring your account"
msgstr "監察您戶口的活動"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:43
msgid ""
"Check statements, emails, and SMS notifications promptly. Report unusual "
"transactions immediately."
msgstr "收到結單、電郵和短訊提示後請盡快查閱。若發現有任何不尋常的交易，請立即通知本行。建議使用滙豐網上理財或滙豐流動理財應用程式，經常查閱您戶口的交易記錄"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:44
msgid ""
"Use HSBC Online Banking or the Mobile Banking app to check transactions "
"frequently."
msgstr "建議使用滙豐網上理財或滙豐流動理財應用程式，經常查閱您戶口的交易記錄"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:45
msgid ""
"Keep electronic receipts for transfers and bill payments to help verify "
"transactions."
msgstr "凡進行轉帳和繳付帳單的交易，都應保存電子收據，以作交易驗證之用"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:48
msgid "Protecting your PIN"
msgstr "保護您的密碼"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:50
msgid ""
"Never tell your PIN to anyone, even if they claim to be from HSBC or the "
"police."
msgstr "切勿向任何人透露您的密碼，即使有人聲稱自己是本行職員或警方人員"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:51
msgid "Memorise your PIN—never write it down."
msgstr "請默記您的密碼，不要寫下"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:52
msgid "Choose a PIN that’s hard to guess."
msgstr "選擇一個難以被人猜中的密碼"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:53
msgid ""
"Use different PINs for different websites/channels (ATM, Phone Banking, "
"Online/Mobile Banking)."
msgstr "於不同的網站及渠道（即自動櫃員機、電話理財、網上及流動理財等）使用不同的密碼"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:54
msgid ""
"HSBC representatives will never ask you to say your Phone PIN out "
"loud—only enter it on your phone keypad."
msgstr "請謹記，我們的客戶代表絕不會要求您讀出自己的電話理財密碼。如需使用電話理財密碼，您只會被要求以電話按鍵輸入"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:59
msgid "How HSBC keeps Personal Internet Banking secure"
msgstr "滙豐使用五個方法來保障個人網上理財的安全"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:61
msgid "Multi-layer log on verification:"
msgstr "多重登入認證"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:61
msgid ""
"Your financial info is protected by a unique username and a one-time "
"security code from your Security Device / Mobile Security Key or a "
"password."
msgstr "您的財務資料受到獨有的用戶名稱及保安編碼器／流動保安編碼產生的一次性保安編碼或密碼所保護。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:61
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "了解更多"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:62
msgid "Transaction verification:"
msgstr "交易驗證"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:62
msgid ""
"When transferring money or paying bills, you’ll be asked for a "
"transaction code generated by your Security Device / Mobile Security Key."
" Only you can authorise payments and transfers."
msgstr "當您轉帳到第三者戶口或網上支付帳單時，滙豐會要求您從保安編碼器／流動保安編碼取得交易保安編碼。這保障只有您本人才能夠授權進行付款或第三者轉帳的要求。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:63
msgid "TLS Encryption:"
msgstr "TLS傳輸加密技術"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:63
msgid "HSBC uses TLS 1.2 encryption, the industry standard."
msgstr "滙豐所採用的TSL 1.2傳輸加密技術是業界公認的標準技術。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:64
msgid "Automatic 'Time-out' feature:"
msgstr "自動「操作時段逾時」功能"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:64
msgid ""
"Always log out and close your browser after banking. HSBC will also "
"automatically log you out after inactivity to protect your data."
msgstr ""
"當您完成使用個人網上理財服務，應該登出並關閉瀏覽器視窗，尤其是在身處公共場所時。若您忘記這樣做，在一段時間內並無任何操作後，系統會自動將您登出個人網上理財。"
" 登入服務後遠離電腦而不顧的做法，會產生個人及敏感資料外洩的風險，並可能因此使您蒙受欺詐"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:65
msgid "SMS/email notifications:"
msgstr "短訊／電郵提示2"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:65
msgid ""
"HSBC will notify you of certain transactions by SMS or email, including "
"details to help you verify them. Call HSBC immediately if you receive an "
"alert for a transaction you don’t recognise."
msgstr "您在滙豐個人網上理財進行若干交易後，會收到我們的文字訊息。為協助您驗證交易，短訊或電郵提示的內容將包括部分受款者的戶口號碼、交易金額及交易時間。如您接收到任何未能確認的交易提示，請即時致電滙豐。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:67
msgid "Learn more about the Security Device / Mobile Security Key"
msgstr "深入了解保安編碼器／流動保安編碼"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:71
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "註："

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:73
msgid ""
"In rare cases, a customer service officer may request personal info by "
"email, but only through HSBC’s secure internet banking platform. You will"
" need to log in to view such messages."
msgstr "1.唯一例外情況是當我們的客戶服務代表透過電郵回覆您的查詢時，其中可能會要求提供一些個人資料。在這情況下，電郵會透過已加密的安全網上理財平台（即滙豐個人網上理財）傳送及儲存；您需要輸入您的用戶名稱和密碼，方可閱覽此類電郵。"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:74
msgid ""
"Review and update your registered mobile phone number regularly via the "
"HSBC HK Mobile Banking app, Online Banking, branch, mail, or hotline."
msgstr "建議您透過香港滙豐流動理財應用程式／網上理財、親臨分行、郵寄或致電我們的客戶服務熱線，以查看及更新您於本行已登記的手提電話號碼。請前往我們的"

#: frontend/templates/safe-internet-banking.html:74
msgid "Instructions here"
msgstr "「更新聯絡資料」頁面了解更多詳情。"

